# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/2.0.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [0.10.4] - 2026-07-31

### Fixed

- Rename `code` to `errorCode` on Query custom exceptions.

## [0.10.3] - 2026-07-31

### Fixed

- Some constants were not available on `ConsoleLogger`.

## [0.10.2] - 2026-07-31

### Fixed

- `AbstractQueryHandler` was assigning badly the values related to cache.

## [0.10.1] - 2026-07-31

### Fixed

- Rename `console-logger` file to `ConsoleLogger`.

## [0.10.0] - 2026-07-31

### Added

- Added `toArray` to `QueryPrimitives`.

## [0.9.0] - 2026-07-31

### Added

- Added `AggregateRoot`.

## [0.8.0] - 2026-07-31

### Added

- Added CQRS/Query related (Bus, Handler).

## [0.7.2] - 2026-07-23

### Changed

- Convert `DAO` from `abstract class` to `interface`.

## [0.7.1] - 2026-06-20

### Changed

- Rename folders to use Pascal Case.

## [0.7.0] - 2026-06-20

### Added

- Added `Result`.

## [0.6.0] - 2026-06-19

### Added

- Added `EntityNotRecoverable` exception.

## [0.5.1] - 2026-06-19

### Added

- Added `includeDeleted` on DAO methods.

## [0.5.0] - 2026-06-19

### Added

- Added `OrderNotValid` exception.

## [0.4.0] - 2026-06-19

### Added

- Added `OperatorNotValid` exception.

## [0.3.0] - 2026-06-19

### Added

- Added `EntityRegistry` to entity module.

## [0.2.0] - 2026-06-19

### Added

- Added Formatters module.

## [0.1.0] - 2026-06-17

### Added

- Added Criteria module.
- Added DAO module.
- Added DomainEvent module.
- Added Entity module.
- Added Logger module.
- Added Model module.
- Added UnitOfWork module.
- Added ValueObjects module.

